        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 854, 1.25 Inch Diameter Precision Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith transitional style that you'll love, the Precision Cabinet Knob is trending in today's home decor scene. The 1-1/4 Inch Precision Cabinet Knob is available in a few popular finish colors options. This stunning kitchen cabinet pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"/site/search.cfm?search=MNG+ Precision\">MNG Precision Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 854 Precision Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
